e_item_assets/steam/apps/3711170/extras/3649d8501cf3fc00debd43270af780b5.avif?t=1780131267\" width=463 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Soon, every choice you make... will become ice picks stabbing your conscience</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711170/extras/755dd0c7e60578d846d6d3f48a3b97f1.avif?t=1780131267\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711170/extras_big/755dd0c7e60578d846d6d3f48a3b97f1.webp?t=1780131267 width=1600 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▌ <strong>Ultimate Combat Experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Video Specs:</strong> 1080P, 30,000 kbps bitrate, 50 FPS cinematics for smoother action sequences!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perspective:</strong> An 80% first-person and 20% third-person narrative blend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio:</strong> Recorded with live sound (on-set audio).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711170/extras/93e46b3f54f27ad6adb4b93fc78b2118.poster.avif?t=1780131267\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711170/extras/93e46b3f54f27ad6adb4b93fc78b2118.webm?t=1780131267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711170/extras/93e46b3f54f27ad6adb4b93fc78b2118.mp4?t=1780131267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor